      "content": "Thanks, that looks good. Can you make it sound a bit more firm though? Like, we've had a few issues with these shipping amounts lately and I want them to know we're definitely keeping a close eye on it. Also, could you add a line asking them to verify their warehouse logs against our receiving reports?",
