      "content": "That's better. It sounds much more serious. One more thing—since this keeps happening, I'm worried there's some kind of error in their tracking system or something weird going on with how they log the shipments. Do you think it's possible for inventory numbers to just... vanish or be recorded wrong like that? It feels like things are just disappearing into thin air.",
